                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00 R 296/2262: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Herrick</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-07T10:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 7, 1928—10
                                a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>160. Reparation 53. Your Reparation 97, June 4, 4 p.m.<anchor n="34"
                        xml:id="d858-f1"/> Wilson is authorized to sign protocol substantially
                    conforming to draft transmitted with letter of May 9.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
